  "sketch": "// Blink: D13 -> 220 ohm -> red LED -> GND\nint ledPin = 13;\n\nvoid setup() {\n  pinMode(ledPin, OUTPUT);\n  Serial.begin(9600);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  digitalWrite(ledPin, HIGH);\n  Serial.println(\"LED on\");\n  delay(500);\n  digitalWrite(ledPin, LOW);\n  Serial.println(\"LED off\");\n  delay(500);\n}\n"
}
